cassini-talk (0.3.0) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Add the meeting Library, import, export and search across meetings.
  * Record independent browser meetings, choose sources and support the
    companion through the Flatpak host bridge.
  * Bundle offline writing down and offer optional Parakeet Ultra,
    speaker separation and saved voices.
  * Preserve native input gaps without accumulating device-clock drift.

